			"notes": "## What's changed\n\n* chore!: rename DancingSquared to HateFrance\n* feat(AutoExperiments): automatically select the highest playable stakes, start experiments, and reopen the table for the next available experiment\n* fix(AutoExperiments): correct click delays, sequence handling, and detection of completed, locked, or unavailable experiments\n* fix(AutoClicker): correct mouse and keyboard input handling, item swap protection, and whitelist matching\n* fix: restrict Dance Room automation to the correct location in the Rift and process subtitle and sound packets on the client thread\n* chore: update to NoammAddons 1.3.2\n* chore(deps): update Fabric, Kotlin, UniversalCraft, and Mod Menu dependencies\n\n### Updating from DancingSquared\n\nRemove the old DancingSquared JAR before installing HateFrance.\n\nTo use Auto Start, enable the option in AutoExperiments, open the Experimentation Table, and keep looking at it.\n\n### Compatibility\n\n* Minecraft 26.1.2, 26.2, and 26.3\n* Requires NoammAddons 1.3.2 for the matching Minecraft version\n* Requires Fabric Loader 0.19.5 or later and Java 25 or later\n* Requires Fabric Language Kotlin 1.14.2+kotlin.2.4.21 or later\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jcnlk/HateFrance/compare/1.3.1...1.3.2"
